- Exclude `github_auth` outcomes from persisted report metrics and source details: Auth-dead results are Actions-log-only and must not appear as processed source PRs.
- Represent zero-spawn runs with an explicit fixture: This locks the exact `N/A (run #N)` Summary contract without inventing wall-clock data.
- Model a payload-less failed subagent by omitting `duration_seconds`: This verifies the literal `duration unknown` fallback instead of assigning a fabricated duration.

