## Constraints Identified
- Report tests and helpers must remain shell/jq-only: All filtering and assertions use Bash and jq with no Python dependency.
- Auth-dead payloads cannot be persisted: Their PR number, sentinel duration, metrics, and detail rows must remain absent from the report.
- The fix commit is limited to reviewer findings: No skill invocation order, progress schema, workflow behavior, or vault data changed.

